Revision history for Plack-Middleware-CSP

0.04    20261110
        - Fixed the test's nonce extraction: it assumed lowercase hex, but
          HTTP::CSPHeader changed the nonce to a longer mixed-case form in
          v0.4.0 (2024-12-17), so the pattern matched nothing and the test
          failed 2 of 4 subtests on CPAN Testers. It now captures the quoted
          nonce value, which fits any format. Surfaced by CPAN Testers report
          5cb3cd5a-aa39-11f1-8dda-882129416618.

0.03    20261110
        - Fixed the response header name: it was "content-security-protocol",
          which no browser reads, so the policy was never enforced. It is now
          "Content-Security-Policy" ("policy", not "protocol"). Reported by
          lmasarati as github issue #1.

0.02    20220630
        - Added reference to older version on github by Leon Timmermans.
        - Added a test skip for the Win32 boxes that cannot install HTTP::CSPHeader.
        - Made _csp and _nonce "private" methods to improve kwalitee.
        - Adding META.json (from MYMETA.json) for the same reason.

0.01    20220628
        - Alpha release. Looks okay. :P
